sequenceDiagram
  actor L as Learner
  participant UI as workspace.js
  participant G as grading.js
  participant Q as queue.js
  participant V as vault.js + crypto.js
  participant DB as IndexedDB
  L->>UI: Type an answer and press Check
  UI->>G: grade(exercise, answer)
  G-->>UI: correct or incorrect
  opt correct, and first time for this stage
    UI->>Q: enqueue stage-complete event
    Q->>V: queueAdd(event)
    V->>DB: AES-GCM encrypt, add to queue store
  end
  UI->>V: save progress
  V->>DB: AES-GCM encrypt, put in data store
  UI-->>L: Feedback and progress bar update
  Note over UI,DB: No network call is made. The event waits, encrypted, in IndexedDB.
  Note over UI,DB: flush() runs on the browser online event, but only sends if a sender is registered through setSender(). None is registered yet.
